# Tor configuration template for Tether OS
# Copy to /etc/tor/torrc (Unix) or Tor Browser's Data/Tor/torrc (Windows)

## SOCKS proxy
SOCKSPort 127.0.0.1:9050

## Control port (required for Tether OS rotation)
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
## Uncomment and generate with: tor --hash-password 'your_password'
# HashedControlPassword 16:...

## Exit node country selection (optional - uncomment to restrict)
# ExitNodes {us},{ca},{de},{gb},{nl},{jp},{au}

## Privacy hardening
ExitRelay 0
BridgeRelay 0
CircuitBuildTimeout 30
LearnCircuitBuildTimeout 0
MaxCircuitDirtiness 600
NewCircuitPeriod 60

## Logging
Log notice file /var/log/tor/tether.log
